# Ajani, Caller of the Pride, -3: "Target creature gains flying and double strike until end of turn." On turn 3 Bot1 -3s the
# Memnite (Ajani 4 to 1; a noncreature Mox Pearl is refused as the target) and attacks with it. Bot2's Isamaru cannot block a
# creature with flying (CR 702.9b), and the Memnite deals first-strike damage and then regular damage (CR 702.4b): 2 damage, Bot2 at
# 18. The effect lasts only until end of turn (CR 514.2): on turn 5 the Memnite has neither keyword, Isamaru blocks and kills it (a
# positive control for the refused block), and with Ajani at 1 loyalty the -3 cannot be paid again (CR 606.6) while the +1 can.

